TrackMe 1.6.3

• Start a ride you can back out of — the radial Start gesture now cancels cleanly when you return to center, and ride starts are abortable.
• New in-app Help & Feedback, with accessible navigation.
• More reliable saving to your gallery across Android versions.
• A live, updating notification while you're recording a ride.
• Smoother first run: clearer location-permission ordering.
• Broader localization — more of the app speaks your language.
• Stability, telemetry, and polish under the hood.
